{"id":"9796412f33541cd3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-graph-coloring.md","title":"Graph Coloring","display":"df-graph-coloring — Graph Coloring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-graph-coloring","aliases":["28-df-graph-coloring","GRAPH-COLORING","3-COLORING"],"display":"df-graph-coloring — Graph Coloring","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-graph-coloring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-graph-coloring</span><span>GRAPH-COLORING</span><span>3-COLORING</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-coloring — Graph Coloring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{COLOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,k)\\mid{}&amp;G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c:V\\to\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\forall\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\;(c(u)\\ne c(v))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{3COLOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,3)\\mid{}&amp;G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,3)\\in\\mathrm{COLOR}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{COLOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,k)\\mid{}&amp;G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c:V\\to\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\forall\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\;(c(u)\\ne c(v))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{3COLOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,3)\\mid{}&amp;G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}(G,3)\\in\\mathrm{COLOR}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空图允许空着色函数。无效编码不属于语言；颜色数取正整数。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.2；印刷63页；PDF89页。定义已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 